+ * Lives in the REAL infracfg syscon @0x10001000 (NOT the 0x10003000 pericfg
+ * we map as infracfg_ao). Mainline scpsys' CONN bp_cfg targets the same bits
+ * but uses BUS_PROT_WR_IGN (no STA poll) and the domain gets re-disabled as
